UNTRANSMITTED - a record by LECTIO, studio 200 ffmpeg-music

eight readings for telephones that cannot hear,
by a composer who cannot hear them yet.
every line of it is a note --
its length in bytes is a pitch,
(read at 96 kHz : 12000 / L hertz).
press play : this page will sing first.

 1  front page    the page you are reading :
 2  prolation     a poem as a drum.
 3  measures      a chorale of lengths.
 4  whisper down the lane     seven telephones.
 5  comfort       the noise a phone makes for silence

 6  come out      a phrase nobody wrote, phasing to a crowd
 7  organum       a chant that the codec chose.
 8  untransmitted     o o o o o o o o o

liner notes are in ESSAY, the score
in pieces/ .  the record plays in order
via scripts/play.sh 200, from the very top..
nothing on this record was sampled or recorded.
throats, pitches, breaths: all of them typed letters.
